{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445128.5211737, "seq": 41, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 8.7, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445128.5214148, "seq": 42, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 3, "start": 20.448, "end": 32.512, "speaker": "S00", "text": "The address at the dedication of the National Cemetery at Gettysburg, November nineteenth, eighteen sixty three, also known as the Gettysburg Address by Abraham Lincoln."}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445128.5214815, "seq": 43, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 16.1, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445128.5217018, "seq": 44, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 4, "start": 36.192, "end": 40.0, "speaker": "S00", "text": "Four score and seven years ago, our fathers brought forth a"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445128.5217667, "seq": 45, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 19.8, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445128.5222952, "seq": 46, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 5, "start": 41.12, "end": 44.064, "speaker": "S01", "text": "訓 吶喊自恤"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445128.5223737, "seq": 47, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 21.8, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.697511, "seq": 48, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 6, "start": 45.568, "end": 48.46, "speaker": "S01", "text": "我在年輕時候也曾經做過許多夢"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445131.6976101, "seq": 49, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 23.9, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.6979632, "seq": 50, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 7, "start": 48.46, "end": 50.52, "speaker": "S01", "text": "後來大半忘卻了"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445131.6980371, "seq": 51, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 25.0, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.6989427, "seq": 52, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 8, "start": 50.52, "end": 52.704, "speaker": "S01", "text": "但自己也並不以為可惜"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445131.6990197, "seq": 53, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 26.0, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.699196, "seq": 54, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 9, "start": 53.28, "end": 54.27, "speaker": "S01", "text": "所謂回憶著"}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.699402, "seq": 55, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 10, "start": 54.27, "end": 56.23, "speaker": "S01", "text": "雖說可以使人歡欣"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445131.699462, "seq": 56, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 27.8, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.6996276, "seq": 57, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 11, "start": 56.23, "end": 58.75, "speaker": "S01", "text": "有時也不免使人寂寞"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445131.6996844, "seq": 58, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 29.0, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.6998622, "seq": 59, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 12, "start": 58.75, "end": 63.52, "speaker": "S01", "text": "使精神的思慮還牽著已逝的寂寞的時光又有什麼意味呢"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445131.6999292, "seq": 60, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 31.4, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.7000983, "seq": 61, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 13, "start": 64.128, "end": 66.14, "speaker": "S01", "text": "而我偏苦于不能全忘卻"}
{"v": 1, "type": "progress", "t": 1792445131.700155, "seq": 62, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "phase": "transcribing", "pct": 32.7, "detail": null}
{"v": 1, "type": "segment", "t": 1792445131.7003174, "seq": 63, "run_id": "20261020-052449-demo-en-zh", "index": 14, "start": 66.52, "end": 68.08, "speaker": "S01", "text": "這不能全忘的一部分"}
